stateDiagram-v2
  direction TB
  [*] --> PLAYING: both teams ready
  PLAYING --> END_REQUESTED: a leader requests the end<br/>(5-minute score deadline starts)
  END_REQUESTED --> PLAYING: other leader rejects
  END_REQUESTED --> AWAITING_SCORE: first team submits
  AWAITING_SCORE --> VALIDATING_RESULT: second team submits
  VALIDATING_RESULT --> COMPLETED: exactly one team reached the target
  VALIDATING_RESULT --> INVALID_SCORE: tie, or zero or two teams reached it
  INVALID_SCORE --> VALIDATING_RESULT: both teams submit again
  END_REQUESTED --> CANCELLED: deadline passes
  AWAITING_SCORE --> CANCELLED: deadline passes
  INVALID_SCORE --> CANCELLED: deadline passes
  AWAITING_SCORE --> COMPLETED: administrator decides
  INVALID_SCORE --> COMPLETED: administrator decides
  COMPLETED --> [*]: statistics recorded, rotation applied
  CANCELLED --> [*]: no result, court released
